  <entity00877059:LandLeasePeriodOfRequirementsForFullExemptionOfLandLeasePeriodAndRentForCertainLandLineItemsOfRequirementsForFullExemptionOfLandLeasePeriodAndRentForCertainLandTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00877059_IncheonMetropolitanCityMemberOfCounterpartiesMemberOfRequirementsForFullExemptionOfLandLeasePeriodAndRentForCertainLandTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00877059_ConditionalGovernmentGrantAgreementMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfRequirementsForFullExemptionOfLandLeasePeriodAndRentForCertainLandTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">총 50년간 임대조건으로 최초 임대기간은 토지임대차계약 체결일인 2011년 4월 28일로부터 20년간이며, 이후 10년 단위로 재계약을 체결할 수 있습니다.</entity00877059:LandLeasePeriodOfRequirementsForFullExemptionOfLandLeasePeriodAndRentForCertainLandLineItemsOfRequirementsForFullExemptionOfLandLeasePeriodAndRentForCertainLandTableOfItems>
